@NotesApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5297

### Alice's teams
GET {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/teams
X-User-Id: 1

### Development notes as Alice
GET {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/teams/1/notes
X-User-Id: 1

### Bob is not in Operations (expect 403)
GET {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/teams/2/notes
X-User-Id: 2

### No header (expect 401)
GET {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/teams/1/notes

### Bob creates a note in Development (expect 201)
POST {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/teams/1/notes
X-User-Id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Release checklist",
  "content": "Tag the build, run smoke tests, notify Ops."
}

### Search (expect the release note)
GET {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/teams/1/notes?search=release
X-User-Id: 1

### Update note 1 with the current version (expect 200, version becomes 2)
PUT {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sprint planning (updated)",
  "content": "Agenda for Monday's planning session.",
  "version": 1
}

### Same update again with the old version (expect 409)
PUT {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
X-User-Id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bob's edit",
  "content": "Overwriting with an old copy.",
  "version": 1
}

### Delete note 1 (expect 204)
DELETE {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
X-User-Id: 1

### Get the deleted note (expect 404)
GET {{NotesApi_HostAddress}}/api/notes/1
X-User-Id: 1